Z||000002||PaUL||04-09-99||02:12 PM||||Ive changed the outer door rubbers once. They are screwed into the door from inside the door. You need to temporarily remove the window to get at the middle screws since the windows on the fiero dont go all the way down. I cant believe early models have a different strip, the ones for the newer models will probably fit.
